    "realtimeExamples": "Example 1 - Easy: A constant vertical field through a horizontal unit square has flux 1.\nExample 2 - Contrast: State the curve, surface, orientation, and field before applying a theorem.\nExample 3 - Application: It is used in fluid flow, electromagnetism, work, circulation, and flux.\nVisual Understanding: Draw arrows for the vector field and mark the curve or surface orientation.",
