    "realtimeExamples": "Example 1 - Easy: Integers form a ring.\nExample 2 - Contrast: Check closure, identity, inverse, associativity, and compatibility conditions as required.\nExample 3 - Application: It is used in symmetry, number theory, coding, cryptography, and higher algebra.\nVisual Understanding: Use operation tables, symmetry moves, residue classes, or mapping diagrams.",
