    "realtimeExamples": "Example 1 - Easy: [0,1] is closed in R.\nExample 2 - Contrast: Use the distance function and the exact definition for the space.\nExample 3 - Application: It is used in analysis, topology, fixed-point theory, approximation, and functional analysis.\nVisual Understanding: Draw points with distance balls around them and watch which points are included.",
